# Committed comparison inputs only: reference.jpg, its crop reference-canvas.png
# (scripts/make-reference-canvas.mjs) and the documented Arcentry fidelity
# milestones (scene-json-arcentry*.png). Render tests write review shots to
# ../../artifacts/render/ and the fidelity run to ../../artifacts/visual/
# (src/visual/artifacts-layout.test.ts). The *.png rule stays so stray PNGs from
# older checkouts or the tuner are never committed by accident.
*.png
!reference-canvas.png
!scene-json-arcentry*.png
